{"title": "Hand-Drawn Map", "pageid": 12808, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hand-Drawn_Map", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_M_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Book_Note_M_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_M_Image.png.webp, /w/images/8/89/Book_Note_M_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Hand-Drawn Map image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Book_Note_M_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_M_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Book_Note_M_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Hand-Drawn Map</b> is a map of <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a>. Although the author is not stated, the map might be drawn by <a href=\"/wiki/Philomeen\" title=\"Philomeen\">Philomeen</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A map of Grymforge, drafted with a careful hand.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Philomeen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Philomeen\" title=\"Philomeen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Portrait_Philomeen.png/25px-Portrait_Philomeen.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Portrait_Philomeen